- Great Expectations validation at each zone transition
- Metadata-driven configuration (no hardcoded logic)
- Deterministic execution plan generation
- Control Plane / Data Plane separation

Used by: P01-P09 pattern templates (auto-created if missing)

Mandatory Blocks (override in child templates):
