"""
APEX Pattern {% block pattern_code %}BASE{% endblock %}: {% block pattern_name %}Base Medallion Pipeline{% endblock %}
Generated by APEX Data Agent (Deterministic, Metadata-Driven)

Pattern: {% block pattern_description %}5-Zone Medallion Architecture{% endblock %}
Contract Type: {{ contract_type | default('STANDARD') }}

DAG ID: {{ dag_id }}
Feed ID: {{ feed_id }}
Domain: {{ domain }}
Environment: {{ environment | default('dev') }}

CONTROL PLANE: This DAG executes a ResolvedExecutionPlan (no decisions in Spark jobs)
DATA PLANE: Spark jobs read execution plan and execute deterministically

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
ABSOLUTE RULES (enforced by this template):
1. Metadata Is Single Source of Truth - No hardcoded schema/logic/transforms
2. Thin DAGs Only - DAGs contain ONLY orchestration, import all logic
3. Control Plane vs Data Plane - Control Plane makes decisions, Data Plane executes
4. Deterministic Output - Same input → Same artifacts
5. Uniform Zone Processing - All zones follow identical 7-step pattern
6. GE Validation - Schema + Semantic validation per zone
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
"""

